# ── Model files: the cloud set is committed ──────────────────────────
# models/tflite/ and models/onnx/ ARE the cloud source the app downloads
# from (via GitHub proxy): every model listed in models/models.json has to
# be present here, or its download 404s for everyone regardless of network.
# Any other model binary stays device-local and must never be committed.
#
# This list used to name the files one by one, and it silently went stale
# the moment models were added to the manifest — three models ended up
# advertised but never committed. The rule is now "everything in the cloud
# directories", so adding a file to models.json is enough.
*.tflite
*.onnx
*.part
/models/*
!/models/models.json
!/models/tflite/
!/models/onnx/
/models/tflite/*
/models/onnx/*
!/models/tflite/*.tflite
!/models/onnx/*.onnx

